{"2900240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Get Colossal", "steam_appid": 2900240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get Colossal is a giant robot arena brawler/party game with huge unit size differences and fully destructible environments.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>…and hotdog carts!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inertia/physics based combat focusing on feeling of massive scale and cinematic robot/kaiju-movie inspired heavy weight brawling with massive destruction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start as a tiny human and by collecting Quantum Cubes through out the match you grow into a mighty Mech and eventually a huge Titan! The bigger you are, the more powerful and destructive you become. But to truly become the ultimate badass on the block you must master fighting in all sizes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump right in, no grinding required! Choose from <strong>8 unique characters</strong> and fight across <strong>4 fully destructible arenas</strong> in <strong>3 game modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BREAK THE RIFT: 2vs2 matched online multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAYHEM: 4 player free for all multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BADASS: 1vs1-7 local singleplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRAWL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your friends as tiny humans and huge super heavy robots for destructive, chaotic fun online and on the couch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/extras/f720d7331c3eb83be40b9cb0f77dad63.poster.avif?t=1769173494\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/extras/f720d7331c3eb83be40b9cb0f77dad63.webm?t=1769173494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SMALL VS. BIG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the tiniest human can make a difference! Be the annoying tiny insect and drain cubes and disorient the big guys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/extras/41e394c1307a23ad6ef9482a594aa9f9.poster.avif?t=1769173494\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/extras/41e394c1307a23ad6ef9482a594aa9f9.webm?t=1769173494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/extras/41e394c1307a23ad6ef9482a594aa9f9.mp4?t=1769173494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock your opponents out and pick up their Quantum Cubes to fuel your growth to ultimate badassery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/extras/2ed1ebaf78d4c95d0fdc52e7f5a32e9e.poster.avif?t=1769173494\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/extras/2ed1ebaf78d4c95d0fdc52e7f5a32e9e.webm?t=1769173494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/extras/2ed1ebaf78d4c95d0fdc52e7f5a32e9e.mp4?t=1769173494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GROW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters have 3 sizes with unique abilities. Bigger is usually better… but beware, the bigger you are the bigger target you are for others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/extras/6bbb92bc001fb058aff41c6f82cc8ebe.poster.avif?t=1769173494\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/extras/6bbb92bc001fb058aff41c6f82cc8ebe.webm?t=1769173494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/extras/6bbb92bc001fb058aff41c6f82cc8ebe.mp4?t=1769173494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>USE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize power-ups with your teammates and turn a match to an unexpected victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/extras/2dbbd401c7baaf706bdf0ea4281d07d1.poster.avif?t=1769173494\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/extras/2dbbd401c7baaf706bdf0ea4281d07d1.webm?t=1769173494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get Colossal is a giant robot arena brawler/party game with huge unit size differences and fully destructible environments.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>…and hotdog carts!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inertia/physics based combat focusing on feeling of massive scale and cinematic robot/kaiju-movie inspired heavy weight brawling with massive destruction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start as a tiny human and by collecting Quantum Cubes through out the match you grow into a mighty Mech and eventually a huge Titan! The bigger you are, the more powerful and destructive you become. But to truly become the ultimate badass on the block you must master fighting in all sizes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump right in, no grinding required! Choose from <strong>8 unique characters</strong> and fight across <strong>4 fully destructible arenas</strong> in <strong>3 game modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BREAK THE RIFT: 2vs2 matched online multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAYHEM: 4 player free for all multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BADASS: 1vs1-7 local singleplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRAWL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your friends as tiny humans and huge super heavy robots for destructive, chaotic fun online and on the couch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/extras/f720d7331c3eb83be40b9cb0f77dad63.poster.avif?t=1769173494\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/extras/f720d7331c3eb83be40b9cb0f77dad63.webm?t=1769173494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SMALL VS. BIG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the tiniest human can make a difference! Be the annoying tiny insect and drain cubes and disorient the big guys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/extras/41e394c1307a23ad6ef9482a594aa9f9.poster.avif?t=1769173494\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.