0240/extras/6bbb92bc001fb058aff41c6f82cc8ebe.mp4?t=1769173494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>USE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize power-ups with your teammates and turn a match to an unexpected victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/extras/2dbbd401c7baaf706bdf0ea4281d07d1.poster.avif?t=1769173494\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/extras/2dbbd401c7baaf706bdf0ea4281d07d1.webm?t=1769173494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Giant robot arena brawler/party game with huge unit size differences and inertia/physics based combat. Slug it out as tiny humans and giant robots in fully destructible environments! Team up with friends and prove your ultimate badassery. Get smacked! Get EVEN! Get EVEN BIGGER! GET COLOSSAL!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/103aad202c752b58538ebbecbd162f13b7a65430/header.jpg?t=1769173494", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/c573ee3ff456464d73fc8782e7ea94aad80f16da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769173494", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900240/c573ee3ff456464d73fc8782e7ea94aad80f16da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769173494", "website": "https://www.glitchhammer.games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8300H<br></li><li><strong>Memory